WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.947
Vinnie wanted to stay longer at the Crystal Palace, but Florence wanted to leave.

2
00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:19.344
"I didn't get to see everything," Vinnie complained.

3
00:00:19.345 --> 00:00:22.959
"Hush, Florence needs our help,"

4
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.826
Mandy whispered as the children followed Florence outside.

5
00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:32.325
Suddenly, Florence cried out, "Miss Charlotte!"

6
00:00:32.326 --> 00:00:37.621
A girl about Mandy's age was walking on the other side of the street.

7
00:00:37.622 --> 00:00:40.545
She stopped when she saw Florence.

8
00:00:40.546 --> 00:00:44.772
"Miss Charlotte!" cried Florence again.

9
00:00:44.773 --> 00:00:48.687
Charlotte crossed the street looking very sorry.

10
00:00:48.688 --> 00:00:53.846
"This is most upsetting," Florence said to her.

11
00:00:53.847 --> 00:00:57.302
"Don't be angry," Charlotte said.

12
00:00:57.303 --> 00:01:01.968
"I just wanted to have some fun by myself."

13
00:01:01.969 --> 00:01:06.370
"Well, it wasn't fun for me!" Florence said.

14
00:01:06.371 --> 00:01:08.259
"Who are you?"

15
00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:12.289
asked Charlotte, looking at Vinnie and Mandy.

16
00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:15.827
Florence introduced the children to her.

17
00:01:15.828 --> 00:01:20.389
"You're visiting London?" Charlotte said excitedly.

18
00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.821
"Florence, we must show them around.

19
00:01:23.822 --> 00:01:26.834
We can go to father's factory!"

20
00:01:26.835 --> 00:01:30.559
"A factory?" asked Mandy.

21
00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:36.096
After the Crystal Palace, a factory didn't sound very interesting.

22
00:01:36.097 --> 00:01:40.889
"Your father wouldn't like it," began Florence.

23
00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:45.535
"Would you like to go?" Charlotte asked the children.

24
00:01:45.536 --> 00:01:48.649
"Well," replied Vinnie.

25
00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:52.791
"We can take that cab!" Charlotte exclaimed.

26
00:01:52.792 --> 00:01:58.884
She ran to a nearby carriage and got in before Florence could object.

27
00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.658
"This is a cab?"

28
00:02:00.659 --> 00:02:06.013
whispered Vinnie, climbing into the horse-drawn carriage.

29
00:02:06.014 --> 00:02:08.907
"Cool!"

30
00:02:08.908 --> 00:02:12.871
The carriage rolled through the London streets.

31
00:02:12.872 --> 00:02:18.355
The children listened to the pleasant clip-clop of the horse's hooves.

32
00:02:18.356 --> 00:02:25.324
As they rode through the city, Mandy noticed the streets changing.

33
00:02:25.325 --> 00:02:33.376
The colorful streets, alive with people and shops, became dark and empty.

34
00:02:33.377 --> 00:02:37.322
"Where is everyone?" asked Mandy.

35
00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:40.366
She looked out the carriage window.

36
00:02:40.367 --> 00:02:44.243
Poorly dressed children were playing outside.

37
00:02:44.244 --> 00:02:48.005
A few older people sat on doorsteps.

38
00:02:48.006 --> 00:02:52.763
"Most people are in the factories," explained Florence.

39
00:02:52.764 --> 00:02:56.690
Then she pointed to some big, brick buildings.

40
00:02:56.691 --> 00:03:01.346
Their tall chimneys poured dark smoke into the sky.

41
00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:05.008
"Are all these buildings factories?"

42
00:03:05.009 --> 00:03:09.195
asked Mandy, looking at the gloomy buildings.

43
00:03:09.196 --> 00:03:12.883
"Yes," said Florence.

44
00:03:12.884 --> 00:03:17.227
"Here we are!" Charlotte called out cheerfully.

45
00:03:17.228 --> 00:03:20.081
They stopped at a factory door.

46
00:03:20.082 --> 00:03:24.326
Charlotte jumped out of the carriage and ran inside.

47
00:03:24.327 --> 00:03:27.990
Florence asked the cab driver to wait for them.

48
00:03:27.991 --> 00:03:33.253
Then Vinnie, Mandy, and Florence followed Charlotte inside.

49
00:03:33.254 --> 00:03:37.916
They walked into a large room filled with long tables.

50
00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:44.331
Ten women sat at each table, among piles of pieces of cloth.

51
00:03:44.332 --> 00:03:48.134
The women were sewing the pieces by hand.

52
00:03:48.135 --> 00:03:51.110
Mandy looked around.

53
00:03:51.111 --> 00:03:55.620
"Vinnie, look!" she said in a shocked voice.

54
00:03:55.621 --> 00:04:03.889
Many of the people working in the factory were children.
